' purpose: strict offline artifact and diagnostic-checkpoint admission source
' covers: packages/training/src/artifact_bytes.rs
' covers: packages/training/src/artifacts.rs
' covers: packages/training/src/policy_weights.rs
' covers: packages/training/src/checkpoint.rs
' covers: packages/training/tests/strict_artifacts.rs
' covers: packages/training/tests/checkpoint_state.rs
' status: SOURCE ONLY; compilation, hydration, publication and resume execution remain unverified.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
left to right direction
title Strict artifacts — pure admission is separate from storage and execution
actor "Original bounded bytes\nindependently expected refs/evidence" as INPUT <<host>>
component "artifact_bytes\ncanonical JSON / closed fields / Float64Hex" as BYTES <<app>>
component "artifacts\nregistry / versions / configuration / joins" as ARTIFACT <<app>>
component "policy_weights\nno-bias detached f64[418]" as WEIGHTS <<app>>
component "checkpoint\ncounters / RNG / curriculum / journal evidence" as CHECKPOINT <<app>>
component "Diagnostic values / checked checkpoint\nno Native/publication/resume permit" as RESULT <<app>>
component "ArtifactError\nno partial accepted object" as ERROR <<error>>
INPUT ARROW_MAIN BYTES : original length/digest expectations remain independent
BYTES ARROW_MAIN ARTIFACT : exact canonical bytes and closed DTOs
BYTES ARROW_MAIN CHECKPOINT : checkpoint format stays distinct from inference
ARTIFACT ARROW_MAIN WEIGHTS : exact feature registry and frozen policy shape
WEIGHTS ARROW_MAIN RESULT : zero-init numerical state is not a VALID trained artifact
CHECKPOINT ARROW_MAIN RESULT : require independent committed-state evidence
BYTES ARROW_ERROR ERROR : size, duplicate, schema, encoding or float failure
ARTIFACT ARROW_ERROR ERROR : substituted references or invalid model/configuration
CHECKPOINT ARROW_ERROR ERROR : counters, RNG, bucket or missing-evidence failure
note bottom of BYTES
Artifact<=1MiB; checkpoint<=16MiB
Float64Hex is finite binary64, big-endian
Signed zeros and subnormals remain distinct
No f32 or noncanonical-byte fallback
end note
note bottom of RESULT
No filesystem, activation or training occurs
Table hydration and store publication are separate
Inference stays fail-closed: MissingEvidence
Rust execution and cross-language parity unproved
No Native/session/meter authority is serialized
end note
@enduml
